# 7. Client layer

Any client can connect:

```
Browser
PyQt GUI
Monitoring system
Mobile device
```

Because MJPEG is just HTTP.

The pipeline becomes:

```
Client
   ↓
HTTP request
   ↓
MJPEG server thread
   ↓
frame_condition.wait()
   ↓
send frame
```

Multiple clients share the same frame buffer.

Important property:

```
1 camera encoder
N viewers
```

This avoids launching multiple camera processes.

