# 9. Performance characteristics

Typical Raspberry Pi 4 values:

```
Resolution   : 640x480
Frame rate   : 30 fps
Latency      : ~150–250 ms
CPU usage    : ~6–10%
Clients      : 20–40 supported
```

Most CPU is used by the **encoder**, not Python.

---

# 10. Fault tolerance

Your capture loop automatically restarts the encoder if it crashes:

```
if proc.poll() is not None:
    restart encoder
```

This makes the server self-healing.

So even if the camera driver crashes, the stream recovers automatically.

