# Big picture insight

What you built is basically a **software IP camera**.

Cheap CCTV cameras internally run almost the same pipeline:

```
sensor → encoder → buffer → HTTP/RTSP server
```

The main difference is that commercial cameras usually stream **H264 over RTSP**, while your system uses **MJPEG over HTTP**.

But architecturally, it’s the same idea.

